- The economy has grown,

00:13:37.691 --> 00:13:39.985
but debts, indebtedness
of households,

00:13:39.985 --> 00:13:41.654
firms, banks, governments,

00:13:41.654 --> 00:13:44.323
the debts of all these
actors in economic system

00:13:44.323 --> 00:13:46.867
have increased
much more than GDP.

00:13:46.867 --> 00:13:47.701
- Really?

00:13:47.701 --> 00:13:50.371
- Yeah. So let's say,

00:13:50.371 --> 00:13:52.998
I think maybe in
the 1970s or so the,

00:13:53.833 --> 00:13:57.711
total debt of all these actors,
households, firms, banks,

00:13:57.711 --> 00:14:02.550
government, the total debt
to GDP ratio was maybe of,

00:14:02.550 --> 00:14:05.177
of the order 120%.

00:14:05.177 --> 00:14:07.388
And now that has
increased very steadily

00:14:07.388 --> 00:14:10.766
