00:15:58.958 --> 00:16:00.334
- More than three
times as much debt.

00:16:00.334 --> 00:16:02.461
- It's that access to
credit and the kind of ability

00:16:02.461 --> 00:16:05.839
to take on lots and lots of
debt that hasn't been able

00:16:05.839 --> 00:16:10.803
to sustain this kind of
trend in consumption.

00:16:10.803 --> 00:16:14.223
- So there is a very,
very strong relationship

00:16:14.223 --> 00:16:17.184
