00:16:46.672 --> 00:16:49.049
(soft music)

00:16:54.096 --> 00:16:56.223
- So this is the
Wall Street Bull,

00:16:56.223 --> 00:16:58.600
which is a symbol of
a positive market,

00:16:58.600 --> 00:17:01.395
which means more people
are spending money,

00:17:01.395 --> 00:17:03.230
than spent it the day before.

00:17:03.230 --> 00:17:05.691
- Our democracies basically
have become dependent

00:17:05.691 --> 00:17:09.570
on the idea that there will
