00:17:17.411 --> 00:17:19.872
(soft music)

00:17:26.712 --> 00:17:28.380
- Over the course of my career,

00:17:28.380 --> 00:17:30.466
I've worked in
mathematical modeling.

00:17:30.466 --> 00:17:33.385
I was a space physicist for NASA

00:17:33.385 --> 00:17:35.929
and I was on pretty
big projects.

00:17:35.929 --> 00:17:39.767
I was on the Hubble Space
Telescope team as a scientist.

00:17:39.767 --> 00:17:42.644
(soft music)

00:17:42.644 --> 00:17:46.732
I was on mission to Mars
