00:18:46.375 --> 00:18:48.127
You can't even export your tech.

00:18:48.127 --> 00:18:49.461
You know, all you're left with,

00:18:49.461 --> 00:18:52.631
to survive is you
and your environment.

00:18:52.631 --> 00:18:55.676
(grasshopper buzzing)

00:18:55.676 --> 00:18:57.469
- You know, one of my goals
this year was actually

00:18:57.469 --> 00:19:00.472
to get more educated
on climate change.

00:19:01.473 --> 00:19:04.685
And I took the path

00:19:04.685 --> 00:19:08.147
that I was gonna see both
sides of the argument.

00:19:08.147 --> 00:19:10.482
And what was interesting
to me was I could find

00:19:10.482 --> 00:19:14.695
very little in the
climate denial space.

00:19:14.695 --> 00:19:18.031
The more I read, the
more I see around me,

00:19:18.031 --> 00:19:19.992
the more I get concerned.

00:19:21.827 --> 00:19:24.204
- [Katie] The officials
came out and said,

00:19:24.204 --> 00:19:26.498
we're gonna have to
release the dams.

00:19:26.498 --> 00:19:28.542
And I remember
looking at my husband

00:19:28.542 --> 00:19:33.505
and looking at my daughter
and the dog and the house

00:19:33.505 --> 00:19:37.676
and thinking, am I in
the middle of some movie?

00:19:39.428 --> 00:19:41.054
- So I'm 5.8.

00:19:41.054 --> 00:19:44.266
And the water reached
to about right there.

00:19:45.851 --> 00:19:48.353
Until it happens
to you, you don't,

00:19:48.353 --> 00:19:50.189
you don't believe
that this can happen

00:19:50.189 --> 00:19:52.024
in the United States of America.

00:19:53.066 --> 00:19:56.069
And all of your financial
stability is gone.

00:19:56.069 --> 00:19:58.363
So if we have, God forbid,

00:19:58.363 --> 00:20:00.365
any other emergency that
comes up and believe me,

00:20:00.365 --> 00:20:03.869
that is a source of a
traumatic kind of panic

00:20:03.869 --> 00:20:05.787
that sets in when we go, Oh,

00:20:05.787 --> 00:20:06.914
you know, what if
something happens,

00:20:06.914 --> 00:20:08.207
what if there's
another emergency that,

00:20:08.207 --> 00:20:10.542
that arises, then
we have no funds.

00:20:13.879 --> 00:20:16.590
- Never did I ever
imagine that everything

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:21.136
that I would work so
hard for would be taken

00:20:21.136 --> 00:20:23.972
from me in a matter of hours.

00:20:24.932 --> 00:20:27.768
And so I do believe
that climate change

00:20:27.768 --> 00:20:30.270
is going to have a
huge economic impact.

00:20:32.606 --> 00:20:36.777
And what wealth you
have can be eradicated

00:20:36.777 --> 00:20:39.279
