00:20:47.913 --> 00:20:49.122
(helicopter engine revving)

00:20:49.122 --> 00:20:51.333
- We had a house
up here on the hill

00:20:51.333 --> 00:20:52.793
that my wife wanted
to get out of

00:20:52.793 --> 00:20:55.420
because it was dangerous
