00:21:11.979 --> 00:21:16.441
We had like mud four
feet here, huge rocks.

00:21:16.441 --> 00:21:17.526
- You were here, right?

00:21:17.526 --> 00:21:18.986
- Oh we were.
- How did you get out?

00:21:18.986 --> 00:21:20.654
- Rescued by helicopter man.

00:21:20.654 --> 00:21:22.155
- Jesus.

00:21:22.155 --> 00:21:24.992
- I said, you know, I said,
my wife, we, you got a sheet?

00:21:24.992 --> 00:21:26.493
And she said, yeah.

00:21:26.493 --> 00:21:28.620
I said, what are you
gonna do with the sheets?

00:21:28.620 --> 00:21:30.539
I said, I'm gonna write,
help out there, you know.

00:21:30.622 --> 00:21:33.125
She said maybe make it SOS,
I say that's a good idea.

00:21:33.125 --> 00:21:34.334
(laughs)

00:21:34.334 --> 00:21:37.462
Went out there and
