a SOS or an area code,

00:21:45.345 --> 00:21:46.972
it looked like it
could have been 805.

00:21:46.972 --> 00:21:48.849
And I said, well I gotta
work on my esses man.

00:21:48.849 --> 00:21:50.309
(laughs)

00:21:50.309 --> 00:21:53.020
But we were lucky, you
know, we could afford to...

00:21:53.020 --> 00:21:55.314
